    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to protect your base from relentless enemy hordes in a constantly changing environment? There's only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1752198056\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tides of Lava is a Roguelike Tower Defense game with several unique features not typically found in traditional tower defense games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 1. <strong>Tower Modifications</strong>: Every 2.5 minutes you'll receive a tower modification that applies\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 to all towers of the same type. Combine these mods to customize your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 2. <strong>Grid-based building system:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy the freedom and flexibility of a grid-based building\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 3. <strong>No resources:</strong>\u00a0Manage your builders efficiently as there are no other resource\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 4. <strong>Dynamic Enemy Paths:</strong>\u00a0Enemy paths change over time, keeping you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 5. <strong>Evolving Environments:</strong> Each environment has its own unique quirks and provides you\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 with different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1752198056\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Tides of Lava</strong></i>, no two runs are the same due to the changing enemy paths and environments. When you die, it's game over\u2014you'll need to restart with only your gained experience to help you progress further. How many attempts will it take for you to conquer the game?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to protect your base from relentless enemy hordes in a constantly changing environment? There's only one way to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/3db844256b5c3a5609c991e3daab3dd0.avif?t=1752198056\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tides of Lava is a Roguelike Tower Defense game with several unique features not typically found in traditional tower defense games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 1. <strong>Tower Modifications</strong>: Every 2.5 minutes you'll receive a tower modification that applies\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 to all towers of the same type. Combine these mods to customize your towers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/bd75786622d3864f0ca3cd20f90f5a96.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 2. <strong>Grid-based building system:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy the freedom and flexibility of a grid-based building\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/7bdba5a0ada590165c43d98f355b9b08.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 3. <strong>No resources:</strong>\u00a0Manage your builders efficiently as there are no other resource\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 4. <strong>Dynamic Enemy Paths:</strong>\u00a0Enemy paths change over time, keeping you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.poster.avif?t=1752198056\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.webm?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/aee46251c91d52cd41d8704673cefd9b.mp4?t=1752198056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 5. <strong>Evolving Environments:</strong> Each environment has its own unique quirks and provides you\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 with different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388770/extras/d7a73a8ce2e45042f11f688f51384c7a.avif?t=1752198056\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Tides of Lava</strong></i>, no two runs are the same due to the changing enemy paths and environments. When you die, it's game over\u2014you'll need to restart with only your gained experience to help you progress further. How many attempts will it take for you to conquer the game?</p>",
